var e=[{id:`n_1`,type:`scene_change`,speaker:null,text:null,stage:{bg:`LIFETIME`,bg_animation:null,bgm:`CUTSCENE_HOPE`,filter:`NCFT_NORMAL`,slots:{L:null,C:null,R:null}}},{id:`n_2`,type:`dialog`,speaker:`CHIFUYU_NANA_SUMMER_NULL`,text:{KOREA:`가문의 이름은 잠시 가슴에 묻고, 충의를 다해 당신을 주군으로 모시겠습니다. 고난과 역경은 제가 베어 넘길 테니, 주군은 부디 주군의 뜻을 관철해 주시길.`,JPN:`一族の名はしばらく胸にしまい、社長を我が主と認め、忠義の限りを尽くしましょう。苦難も逆境も、すべて私が斬り伏せます。社長は、ただ己が意志を貫き通してください。`,ENG:`For now, I'll put aside my family and serve you to the best of my ability. Let me take care of all the difficulties ahead of you, so you can focus on your noble mission.`,TWN:`我會暫時把家族之名埋藏在心中，恪盡忠義，將您奉為主君。困難和逆境全由我來斬斷，請主君務必貫徹自己的意志。`},stage:{bg:`LIFETIME`,bg_animation:null,bgm:`CUTSCENE_HOPE`,filter:`NCFT_NORMAL`,slots:{L:null,C:{char_id:`CHIFUYU_NANA_SUMMER_NULL`,face:`UNIT_LAUGH`,hologram:!1},R:null}}}];export{e as default};